      "message": "The @RequiresApi is because we are using android.os.ServiceManager#waitForDeclaredService, which required API level 33.\nChecking that SdkLevel is at least V is an optimization, so we won\u0027t try to connect to a service that is not there.\n\nWe could set @RequiredApi to VANILLA_ICE_CREAM, but it will make no difference and it will prevent the auto merge to udc-mainline-prod.",
